resources.string:
Experimental features are still in testing. Using them may cause the following:

• The UI may display incorrectly or glitch, and the app may crash;
• Some features may be unavailable, or may be changed or removed in later versions;
• Switching the UI engine reloads the entire app interface immediately;
• Liquid Glass may display incorrectly or use more battery on some devices or system versions;
• These features may change at any time and are not guaranteed to behave like stable features.
